<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Vietnamese (vi) for :feature:applock. Mirrors values/strings.xml key for key.

  WORDING BAN (LLM.md §1, §5) carries into every locale: no performance, memory or security claim,
  and no percentage.

  app_lock_clear_body still says, BEFORE the action runs, that the locked-app list goes with the PIN.
  A confirmation that hides half of what it does is not a confirmation in any language.

  lock_screen_prompt still substitutes the target app's own label, so the screen asking for a PIN
  names what it is guarding.
-->
